  "min": 2,
  "blurb": "Staffing is paid for in four common ways: a fixed fee per booking, an hourly mark-up, a percentage of the booking and a subscription. Compare them on the same event, and keep the fee...",
  "intro": "Staffing is paid for in four common ways: a fixed fee per booking, an hourly mark-up, a percentage of the booking and a subscription. Compare them on the same event, and keep the fee separate from the worker's pay and from payroll costs.",
