  "intro": "Indeed Flex offers temporary work across several sectors, including dedicated bartender roles. FF Team is built around bartenders' profiles, professional relationships and event bookings. The better fit depends on the work available near you, the payment arrangements you want, and how you prefer to present and build your professional reputation.\n\nThis page is published by FireFlair, which runs FF Team.",
