  "min": 2,
  "blurb": "Every request arrives as a card with the role, duties, place, date, hours, pay and terms. If you are invited by name, you can accept and confirm, decline or ask a question. If it comes...",
  "intro": "Every request arrives as a card with the role, duties, place, date, hours, pay and terms. If you are invited by name, you can accept and confirm, decline or ask a question. If it comes from Autofill, replying \"Available\" tells the booker you are willing, and the booker then chooses.",
